This is a Vite + React app serving Homey smarthome dashboards as Chromium kiosks on Raspberry Pis. Auth is a Homey token via `homey-api`. Express on the Stue Pi serves `build/` plus `/api`.

| Page | Pi | Screen |
| ---- | -- | ------ |
| `/` Stue | `pi@192.168.68.91` (app server) | Official Pi 7" touch v1, **800×480** landscape |
| `/entre` | `rpi@192.168.68.99` | 13.1" touch, **1920×1080** (`min-width: 1900px`) |
| `/andre` | Raspberry Pi 5 (not in `npm run deploy` yet) | Official Pi **7" Touch Display 2**, **720×1280** portrait, touch-first |

Node LTS via nvm (`.nvmrc` = `lts/*`, engines `^24.19.0`).

## Tooling

- Dev: `npm start` / `npm run dev` (Vite 3000, API 3080, `/api` proxied)
- Production: `npm run start:production` (Express on `PORT`, default 80)
- API only: `npm run start:api` (3080)
- Lint / format / test: `npm run lint`, `npm run format`, `npm run test`
- Health: `npm run verify` — see `verify-http.mdc`
- Deploy: `npm run deploy` from the Mac — see `deploy.mdc`
